  {
   "id": "el110",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1440,
   "y": 540,
   "width": 971.6800000000001,
   "height": 90.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 766744960,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1863693998,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Cache K and V, NOT Q: Q is the current token's question; old K/V never change (causal)\n• Per-step attention: 1 query × t keys = O(t); cache memory = O(T)\n• mha.py: is_causal = past_kv is None  (SDPA's causal mask is top-left aligned when q_len≠k_len)\n• Decode latency ≳ (weight bytes + KV bytes) / HBM bandwidth  → shrink bytes, not FLOPs",
   "originalText": "• Cache K and V, NOT Q: Q is the current token's question; old K/V never change (causal)\n• Per-step attention: 1 query × t keys = O(t); cache memory = O(T)\n• mha.py: is_causal = past_kv is None  (SDPA's causal mask is top-left aligned when q_len≠k_len)\n• Decode latency ≳ (weight bytes + KV bytes) / HBM bandwidth  → shrink bytes, not FLOPs",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
