  {
   "id": "el299",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1440,
   "y": 1350,
   "width": 1013.1200000000001,
   "height": 127.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1718165849,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 873750152,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• GQA dial: num_kv_groups = num_heads → MHA ;  = 1 → MQA.  Cache only G heads, repeat_interleave for math.\n• MLA: cache a low-rank latent per token (independent of head count) + small decoupled RoPE key,\n  because rotation (position-dependent) can't be folded into the static up-projection.\n• Production MLA 'absorbs' W_uk into W_q and W_uv into W_o → attention runs on the latent directly.\n• RoPE (rope.py): rotate Q,K BEFORE caching; new token uses apply_rotary(offset=past_len).\n  Context extension: Position Interpolation → NTK-aware → YaRN (per-frequency ramp).",
   "originalText": "• GQA dial: num_kv_groups = num_heads → MHA ;  = 1 → MQA.  Cache only G heads, repeat_interleave for math.\n• MLA: cache a low-rank latent per token (independent of head count) + small decoupled RoPE key,\n  because rotation (position-dependent) can't be folded into the static up-projection.\n• Production MLA 'absorbs' W_uk into W_q and W_uv into W_o → attention runs on the latent directly.\n• RoPE (rope.py): rotate Q,K BEFORE caching; new token uses apply_rotary(offset=past_len).\n  Context extension: Position Interpolation → NTK-aware → YaRN (per-frequency ramp).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
