   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• All variants share one interface: forward(x, past_kv) → (out, new_cache)\n• Every module has a runnable _demo(); docs/ = MkDocs site, docs/diagrams/ = 12 interactive HTML diagrams\n• S10 PagedAttention = CPU allocation simulation; CUDA FlashAttention/vLLM benches referenced in colab/ (missing)\n• Mac-first: default_device() → MPS or CPU",
   "originalText": "• All variants share one interface: forward(x, past_kv) → (out, new_cache)\n• Every module has a runnable _demo(); docs/ = MkDocs site, docs/diagrams/ = 12 interactive HTML diagrams\n• S10 PagedAttention = CPU allocation simulation; CUDA FlashAttention/vLLM benches referenced in colab/ (missing)\n• Mac-first: default_device() → MPS or CPU",
